WEBVTT

00:33.687 --> 00:36.962
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.437 --> 00:39.800
=Episode 13=

00:39.950 --> 00:42.512
(Mother-in-Law
Is Better Than Father-in-Law)

00:43.800 --> 00:44.920
So that is the inner palace.

00:45.200 --> 00:45.759
Father-in-law,

00:45.759 --> 00:47.790
you have your three thousand beauties
hidden there?

00:48.000 --> 00:50.080
When did I ever have
three thousand in the inner palace?

00:50.080 --> 00:50.919
Who said that?

00:51.119 --> 00:52.000
Everyone says so.

00:52.800 --> 00:53.640
Remember this.

00:53.640 --> 00:54.560
I do not.

00:54.759 --> 00:56.039
Do not put words in my mouth.

00:56.039 --> 00:58.359
If you do not believe it,
ask Ning'an.

00:59.120 --> 01:00.640
What Father says is true.

01:00.670 --> 01:02.519
All the consorts
in the inner palace together

01:02.519 --> 01:03.640
amount to only about thirty.

01:04.199 --> 01:05.559
That is still quite a lot.

01:05.600 --> 01:07.440
If you ask me,
this palace is just too big.

01:07.440 --> 01:09.320
Even visiting
between family takes forever.

01:09.760 --> 01:10.440
One day,

01:10.440 --> 01:12.239
I will redesign the whole place.

01:12.239 --> 01:13.120
Make it multi-level.

01:13.120 --> 01:13.839
More convenient.

01:13.879 --> 01:15.200
You can design residences?

01:15.719 --> 01:16.560
Of course.

01:16.640 --> 01:18.200
If I design my own estate,

01:18.200 --> 01:19.640
it will absolutely impress you.

01:19.640 --> 01:21.200
Then you should give it a try.

01:21.200 --> 01:23.640
Let me see if you are just boasting.

01:24.200 --> 01:25.000
Father,

01:25.399 --> 01:27.600
what about those impeachment memorials?

01:27.600 --> 01:28.600
What else?

01:28.920 --> 01:29.799
We deal with them.

01:31.439 --> 01:33.560
That can be done,

01:34.719 --> 01:35.520
but

01:36.039 --> 01:39.439
you will need to stay in the Ministry
of Justice Prison for a few days.

01:39.920 --> 01:40.719
Is that acceptable?

01:43.520 --> 01:44.240
Father-in-law.

01:44.240 --> 01:44.960
Father.

01:44.960 --> 01:46.400
You are not setting me up, are you?

01:46.799 --> 01:48.840
Do you not trust me?

01:49.310 --> 01:51.580
Go stay in the Ministry
of Justice Prison for a few days.

01:51.640 --> 01:54.120
I will investigate
and deal with a few officials.

01:55.200 --> 01:57.159
As for the workshop,
you can rest assured.

01:57.560 --> 01:59.920
Who would dare compete
with the Imperial Family?

02:00.079 --> 02:01.100
Do they have a death wish?

02:02.040 --> 02:02.640
Also,

02:03.040 --> 02:03.879
for now,

02:04.079 --> 02:06.640
do not tell anyone
I am your father-in-law.

02:07.480 --> 02:08.519
Otherwise,

02:08.680 --> 02:10.200
it will be harder to deal with them.

02:11.959 --> 02:12.760
Father-in-law,

02:13.079 --> 02:15.239
can you not do this another way?

02:15.959 --> 02:17.760
You are familiar
with the Ministry of Justice.

02:17.959 --> 02:19.879
Last time I saw you with the jailers,

02:19.879 --> 02:21.000
you got along quite well.

02:21.100 --> 02:22.280
If I send you somewhere else,

02:22.319 --> 02:24.159
I worry you would not be used to it.

02:24.959 --> 02:26.000
How many days?

02:26.200 --> 02:27.280
Tell me first.

02:27.760 --> 02:28.760
At most ten days.

02:28.760 --> 02:29.840
It will not take that long.

02:30.799 --> 02:32.640
Go back and inform your family.

02:32.640 --> 02:33.910
There is nothing to worry about.

02:33.920 --> 02:34.560
Alright.

02:35.000 --> 02:36.599
But the prison is too cold.

02:36.599 --> 02:37.640
I need to bring some things.

02:37.640 --> 02:38.400
It would be best

02:38.480 --> 02:39.680
if I had a separate space.

02:39.690 --> 02:41.079
I want to bring some tools with me.

02:41.359 --> 02:42.159
What tools?

02:43.319 --> 02:44.120
Books,

02:44.510 --> 02:45.950
writing materials, things like that.

02:46.799 --> 02:47.480
What for?

02:47.640 --> 02:49.239
You plan to do accounts in prison?

02:49.239 --> 02:49.959
Of course.

02:51.120 --> 02:51.919
Look,

02:52.439 --> 02:53.680
the glaze workshop

02:53.879 --> 02:55.280
produces one kiln every five days.

02:55.280 --> 02:56.319
Each kiln is worth forty thousand guan.

02:56.319 --> 02:58.580
In two months, that is
four hundred eighty thousand guan.

02:58.800 --> 02:59.639
We split it evenly.

02:59.650 --> 03:00.400
And there is also

03:00.400 --> 03:02.080
the business from Juxian Restaurant.

03:02.080 --> 03:03.240
That is a lot of money.

03:05.520 --> 03:06.560
So much money,

03:07.199 --> 03:08.639
how do you plan to spend it?

03:08.639 --> 03:09.919
Spend it?

03:10.050 --> 03:11.400
I have not even thought about it.

03:11.400 --> 03:12.580
I have not received any money yet.

03:13.000 --> 03:13.599
Father-in-law,

03:13.599 --> 03:14.400
ask her.

03:14.800 --> 03:16.960
Up to now,
I have not received a single wen.

03:16.960 --> 03:19.439
It is almost the New Year.
I should at least get my share.

03:20.080 --> 03:21.759
He has not been given a single wen?

03:21.759 --> 03:22.639
Exactly.

03:22.639 --> 03:24.280
I have not even recovered
my initial investment.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.919
(This boy has truly given up)

03:26.080 --> 03:27.960
(a lot for Ning'an.)

03:28.380 --> 03:29.510
When the Chinese New Year comes,

03:29.520 --> 03:30.900
you will definitely get your share.

03:31.599 --> 03:32.120
Alright.

03:33.479 --> 03:34.280
However,

03:34.280 --> 03:35.080
Wei Hao,

03:35.400 --> 03:36.199
since

03:36.599 --> 03:38.080
you call me father-in-law,

03:38.520 --> 03:40.599
I must remind you of something.

03:45.319 --> 03:45.919
Hmm...

03:47.840 --> 03:48.639
Think about it.

03:48.719 --> 03:50.759
From just one glaze workshop,

03:51.080 --> 03:52.960
you are already earning this much.

03:54.080 --> 03:55.360
As long as I am still here,

03:55.840 --> 03:57.240
I can help you keep it safe.

03:57.439 --> 03:58.919
But if I am gone,

03:58.919 --> 04:00.240
when the Crown Prince
ascends the throne,

04:00.240 --> 04:02.800
or the next emperor after him,

04:02.800 --> 04:04.719
whether you can still keep this wealth

04:04.960 --> 04:06.159
is uncertain.

04:06.759 --> 04:07.560
Father,

04:07.840 --> 04:09.879
why say such ominous things?

04:10.039 --> 04:11.240
What I mean

04:11.520 --> 04:12.360
is,

04:13.080 --> 04:14.560
having too much money

04:14.560 --> 04:16.280
is not necessarily a good thing.

04:16.280 --> 04:17.280
It is not that

04:17.360 --> 04:19.080
I have set my sights on your wealth.

04:20.599 --> 04:21.960
Remember this,

04:22.240 --> 04:24.039
a small favor brings gratitude,

04:24.199 --> 04:25.599
but too much breeds resentment.

04:26.199 --> 04:27.120
Do you understand?

04:27.960 --> 04:29.159
Right now,

04:29.400 --> 04:31.080
if I choose not to give you your share,

04:31.080 --> 04:32.719
there is nothing you can do about it.

04:32.840 --> 04:34.680
But future emperors may feel

04:34.680 --> 04:36.759
this harms the dignity
of the Imperial Family.

04:37.039 --> 04:37.840
When that time comes,

04:38.240 --> 04:39.919
it could become a disaster instead.

04:40.000 --> 04:40.759
(I did not expect)

04:40.759 --> 04:43.199
(that he would speak so frankly to me.)

04:44.080 --> 04:44.879
Father-in-law,

04:45.439 --> 04:46.960
then what do you suggest?

04:47.879 --> 04:49.159
Keep one share

04:50.360 --> 04:51.520
for yourself.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.439
Sell the remaining four shares

04:53.479 --> 04:54.560
to the Imperial Family.

04:54.560 --> 04:55.319
I

04:55.319 --> 04:56.400
will not pay you in silver.

04:56.430 --> 04:58.280
Instead, I will grant you
an imperial estate,

04:59.399 --> 05:02.120
covering over twenty thousand mu,

05:02.120 --> 05:03.319
along with many residences.

05:03.820 --> 05:06.839
Its value should be around one hundred seventy
to one hundred eighty thousand guan.

05:06.839 --> 05:08.319
In exchange for your four shares.

05:08.319 --> 05:09.079
What do you say?

05:10.920 --> 05:11.439
Alright.

05:11.800 --> 05:12.600
No problem.

05:13.480 --> 05:15.800
I could not hold on to
that much wealth alone anyway.

05:16.759 --> 05:18.839
(Handing it to the Imperial Family
is at least safe.)

05:19.012 --> 05:19.651
Also,

05:20.480 --> 05:21.439
have your family

05:21.500 --> 05:23.460
arrange your coming-of-age ceremony
as soon as possible.

05:23.519 --> 05:24.399
After that,

05:24.439 --> 05:25.820
enter the palace to take up a post.

05:27.160 --> 05:27.959
A post?

05:28.839 --> 05:30.000
Like Cheng Chuchi?

05:30.120 --> 05:31.279
Can I not get up that early?

05:31.279 --> 05:32.520
I do not want to be an official.

05:33.160 --> 05:34.319
Do not even think about it.

05:34.319 --> 05:35.399
I am telling you,

05:35.519 --> 05:36.199
from now on,

05:36.399 --> 05:38.160
you will be the one opening the gates

05:38.160 --> 05:39.279
for court at Ganlu Palace.

05:39.279 --> 05:40.199
No one else.

05:40.199 --> 05:40.519
I...

05:40.839 --> 05:42.720
And you still dare say
I am unreasonable?

05:42.800 --> 05:43.839
Talking nonsense.

05:46.240 --> 05:46.879
I...

05:48.759 --> 05:50.000
Help me talk to Father-in-law.

05:50.010 --> 05:51.290
I do not want to be an official.

06:00.380 --> 06:01.399
Mother-in-law, greetings.

06:02.240 --> 06:03.040
Mother-in-law?

06:03.879 --> 06:04.800
Wei the Fool!

06:06.279 --> 06:08.279
Father-in-law has already agreed
to my marriage with Ning'an.

06:08.959 --> 06:10.279
I did not agree to that.

06:10.319 --> 06:12.150
You were the one insisting
on calling me that.

06:16.040 --> 06:16.839
Alright.

06:18.720 --> 06:19.480
Mother-in-law.

06:19.480 --> 06:20.480
I came in a hurry this time,

06:20.480 --> 06:21.439
so I did not bring anything.

06:21.439 --> 06:23.000
I did not know I would be visiting you.

06:23.000 --> 06:24.079
Please do not take offense.

06:24.279 --> 06:25.279
Next time I come,

06:25.279 --> 06:26.199
I will definitely bring you a gift.

06:26.199 --> 06:27.279
I promise you will like it.

06:28.079 --> 06:29.680
It is enough that you have the thought.

06:30.480 --> 06:31.079
Mother-in-law,

06:31.360 --> 06:32.800
you look truly young.

06:32.810 --> 06:34.279
If I did not know you were the Empress,

06:34.279 --> 06:35.600
I would never believe

06:35.600 --> 06:36.959
you are Ning'an's mother.

06:37.000 --> 06:37.800
You look more like

06:37.920 --> 06:38.920
her elder sister.

06:39.680 --> 06:40.480
So youthful.

06:44.120 --> 06:44.839
Is that so?

06:45.800 --> 06:47.720
(This boy has an excellent appearance,)

06:47.800 --> 06:49.079
(and great ability as well.)

06:49.120 --> 06:49.920
(Not bad.)

06:50.759 --> 06:51.560
Wei Hao,

06:51.839 --> 06:53.639
you are the only son in your family,

06:53.639 --> 06:54.600
with eight elder sisters?

06:54.600 --> 06:55.079
Yes.

06:55.079 --> 06:55.839
I am the only son.

06:55.839 --> 06:56.910
Five generations of a single heir.

06:56.920 --> 06:58.720
All eight of my sisters are married off.

06:58.720 --> 07:01.439
They are not in the capital
and rarely return during the year.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.560
My father went to Bashu

07:02.639 --> 07:04.600
to visit relatives for over half a year,

07:04.600 --> 07:06.570
and he has not even returned
after my title was granted.

07:06.759 --> 07:09.240
But I heard they will come back
for the Chinese New Year.

07:10.000 --> 07:11.150
Since I have been granted a title,

07:11.160 --> 07:13.399
my sisters all want
to come back to see me.

07:15.199 --> 07:16.000
Very good.

07:16.720 --> 07:18.240
(He is an honest child.)

07:20.120 --> 07:22.399
You will dine here
at Fengluan Palace today.

07:22.959 --> 07:26.120
The dishes in the palace may not compare
to those at Juxian Restaurant,

07:26.319 --> 07:27.319
so I have

07:27.319 --> 07:29.480
put effort into selecting

07:29.480 --> 07:30.959
the finest ingredients.

07:31.079 --> 07:32.290
Mother-in-law, you are too kind.

07:33.560 --> 07:34.160
In that case,

07:34.360 --> 07:35.800
tomorrow I will have the palace chefs

07:35.800 --> 07:37.560
come to Juxian Restaurant to learn.

07:37.720 --> 07:39.560
Aside from the current dishes,

07:39.720 --> 07:41.959
I will also provide the recipe

07:41.959 --> 07:42.930
for the roast pigeon
we are about to introduce.

07:42.959 --> 07:44.990
With more practice,
they will master it naturally.

07:45.879 --> 07:48.639
I have long heard the officials speak

07:48.639 --> 07:51.000
of how delicious the food
at Juxian Restaurant is,

07:51.399 --> 07:52.959
yet I have never tasted it myself.

07:53.510 --> 07:54.759
Have my wife bring some for you.

07:55.020 --> 07:56.759
Or you could come dine
with Mother-in-law.

07:58.360 --> 07:59.519
That sounds wonderful.

07:59.720 --> 08:01.000
Hao has a thoughtful heart.

08:01.199 --> 08:02.279
Mother.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.040
How could I let you

08:04.040 --> 08:06.399
miss out on the food
from my Juxian Restaurant?

08:07.319 --> 08:08.000
Good.

08:08.399 --> 08:09.720
Let us go dine.

08:13.120 --> 08:13.990
Mother-in-law, please.

08:15.000 --> 08:16.639
(Still calling himself son-in-law.)

08:17.160 --> 08:19.160
(This fool only knows
how to please the Empress.)

08:19.520 --> 08:22.040
(I want to eat it too, yet I have
to come here to share a meal.)

08:22.079 --> 08:24.439
(Does he even take me,
his father-in-law, seriously?)

08:27.600 --> 08:28.120
Hao.

08:28.120 --> 08:29.000
You are back.

08:29.079 --> 08:30.040
Well, how did it go?

08:30.040 --> 08:31.000
Nothing much.

08:31.480 --> 08:33.480
But you, I told you it was
in the morning.

08:33.480 --> 08:34.680
You dragged me up so early,

08:34.680 --> 08:36.079
I ended up waiting there for ages.

08:36.110 --> 08:38.560
If I had not waited that long,
I would have been back sooner.

08:43.759 --> 08:44.759
Is that so?

08:47.839 --> 08:48.360
Well,

08:48.439 --> 08:51.360
morning is early, is it not?

08:51.759 --> 08:53.040
You have not eaten all day.

08:53.040 --> 08:53.959
You must be hungry.

08:54.519 --> 08:55.319
I have eaten.

08:56.000 --> 08:56.800
Already ate.

08:57.360 --> 08:58.680
His Majesty had a meal prepared?

08:59.000 --> 09:00.360
No, not really a banquet.

09:00.360 --> 09:01.240
Just a simple meal.

09:01.920 --> 09:02.839
That is great.

09:02.920 --> 09:04.759
It shows His Majesty values you.

09:08.079 --> 09:09.519
Do you know who Ning'an is?

09:09.560 --> 09:10.360
A princess.

09:10.399 --> 09:11.560
The Eldest Princess.

09:13.279 --> 09:14.399
The Eldest Princess?

09:14.519 --> 09:15.759
Princess Baoqing?

09:17.600 --> 09:18.159
Then...

09:19.080 --> 09:21.879
You and her...

09:23.240 --> 09:25.240
You two are really...

09:25.279 --> 09:26.320
Of course.

09:26.440 --> 09:28.039
I told you before it was real.

09:28.039 --> 09:29.919
You did not believe me,
you even hit me.

09:30.039 --> 09:31.840
Now I already
call His Majesty father-in-law

09:31.840 --> 09:33.320
and the Empress mother-in-law.

09:35.519 --> 09:36.360
Hao,

09:36.639 --> 09:38.360
you must not lie to me about this.

09:38.360 --> 09:39.559
I will take it seriously.

09:39.799 --> 09:41.000
Of course it is real.

09:41.240 --> 09:42.600
You will see soon enough.

09:43.840 --> 09:44.799
Soon?

09:44.879 --> 09:45.679
Why?

09:46.200 --> 09:48.000
Because I am going to prison.

09:48.240 --> 09:49.279
For a few days.

09:50.080 --> 09:51.000
What?

09:51.720 --> 09:52.559
Prison?

09:53.210 --> 09:55.430
I knew it. You brat,
you must have caused trouble again.

09:55.440 --> 09:57.120
Do not act rashly.

09:57.120 --> 09:57.960
Listen to me.

09:57.960 --> 09:59.120
Let me explain.

09:59.300 --> 10:01.039
You just met His Majesty
and now you are going to prison.

10:01.039 --> 10:01.679
What is there to explain?

10:01.679 --> 10:02.690
You think this is a joke?

10:03.080 --> 10:05.559
I am going to help His Majesty
deal with those great clans.

10:05.639 --> 10:06.879
His Majesty said it himself.

10:08.399 --> 10:09.320
Is that really so?

10:09.320 --> 10:10.240
Of course.

10:10.720 --> 10:12.440
Otherwise, why am I still here now?

10:12.440 --> 10:14.000
Why would I wait until tomorrow?

10:15.039 --> 10:17.960
How could I know in advance
that I would be going in tomorrow?

10:18.120 --> 10:19.039
Think about it.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.120
True?

10:22.559 --> 10:23.360
It is true.

10:26.080 --> 10:27.919
By the way, Aunt,
help me prepare some things.

10:27.919 --> 10:29.559
I need to set up the cell a bit.

10:30.310 --> 10:31.519
Father-in-law already agreed.

10:31.720 --> 10:32.679
I can set up the cell.

10:32.759 --> 10:34.000
He gave me a partitioned space.

10:35.000 --> 10:36.759
Prepare a table,

10:37.519 --> 10:38.399
a couch,

10:38.399 --> 10:39.000
bedding,

10:39.000 --> 10:39.919
and some books.

10:40.039 --> 10:41.580
Set me up with writing materials,
all of it.

10:41.600 --> 10:43.559
And some snacks,

10:43.879 --> 10:45.399
and things I usually like.

10:45.440 --> 10:46.600
Just get them ready.

10:47.000 --> 10:49.399
Are you going to prison
or going to enjoy yourself?

10:49.519 --> 10:50.480
That is not your concern.

10:50.480 --> 10:51.519
Just prepare them for me.

10:53.320 --> 10:54.159
Also, Aunt,

10:54.519 --> 10:56.919
do not tell anyone about me and Ning'an.

10:56.919 --> 10:58.919
His Majesty
plans to use this opportunity

10:58.919 --> 11:00.600
to deal with those great clans.

11:01.159 --> 11:02.480
If you say anything,

11:02.490 --> 11:04.280
not only would my time
in prison be wasted,

11:04.290 --> 11:06.190
His Majesty would also blame me
for mishandling things.

11:11.800 --> 11:13.825
(Juxian Restaurant)

11:14.440 --> 11:16.120
This is Father's fault.

11:16.519 --> 11:17.519
Without you,

11:17.799 --> 11:19.759
there would be no glaze workshop at all.

11:19.919 --> 11:20.919
It is nothing.

11:21.519 --> 11:22.639
Besides the glaze workshop,

11:22.879 --> 11:24.679
I can set up many others.

11:24.679 --> 11:25.639
It just is not necessary.

11:25.639 --> 11:26.590
No need to complicate things.

11:26.639 --> 11:28.399
Earning a comfortable living is enough.

11:28.759 --> 11:29.720
But this workshop

11:29.720 --> 11:31.240
was built by you alone.

11:31.519 --> 11:32.840
I did nothing.

11:33.039 --> 11:34.440
I only put in some money.

11:34.919 --> 11:37.120
You were not short on money back then.

11:37.360 --> 11:38.840
You let me invest

11:38.879 --> 11:40.240
because you wanted to help me.

11:40.720 --> 11:42.080
And now,

11:42.200 --> 11:43.799
Father has taken everything.

11:43.840 --> 11:45.279
You are left with only one share.

11:45.720 --> 11:46.519
It is fine.

11:47.039 --> 11:48.990
Even if we had that wealth,
we could not keep it.

11:49.120 --> 11:49.919
Think about it.

11:50.600 --> 11:52.559
Earning hundreds
of thousands of guan a year,

11:52.559 --> 11:53.919
could we really hold on to that?

11:54.240 --> 11:55.279
Father-in-law is right.

11:55.280 --> 11:57.399
Right now he favors you,
but what about the next emperor?

11:57.399 --> 11:58.480
Will he still favor you?

11:59.000 --> 12:01.120
My brother dotes on me too.

12:01.120 --> 12:01.840
He even

12:01.840 --> 12:03.360
secretly borrows money from me.

12:03.840 --> 12:04.919
You silly girl,

12:05.120 --> 12:06.840
you still do not understand what I mean.

12:09.159 --> 12:09.840
Forget it.

12:10.159 --> 12:11.240
When we get married,

12:11.320 --> 12:13.120
just assign me a few maid attendants.

12:13.279 --> 12:14.200
You fool.

12:14.200 --> 12:15.440
Are you asking for trouble?

12:27.810 --> 12:28.720
Take your time eating.

12:29.200 --> 12:30.159
I am off to prison.

12:32.440 --> 12:33.399
It is cold in there.

12:33.559 --> 12:34.039
You rogue,

12:34.039 --> 12:35.320
bring more blankets.

12:43.919 --> 12:44.960
What are you laughing at?

12:44.960 --> 12:45.600
Keep laughing,

12:46.039 --> 12:48.120
and I will have you all sent over
as his attendants.

12:49.519 --> 12:51.639
If we become his attendants,

12:51.679 --> 12:52.799
then Your Highness,

12:53.159 --> 12:55.240
would you not become the proper wife?

12:56.360 --> 12:57.799
Stop laughing.

13:01.279 --> 13:02.039
Eat up.

13:02.039 --> 13:02.559
Mister Wang.

13:02.559 --> 13:03.440
Add some soup.

13:04.120 --> 13:04.919
Young Master,

13:05.080 --> 13:05.879
this is for you.

13:06.200 --> 13:07.840
(Hand warmer)
Follow this design and make me a stove.

13:08.960 --> 13:09.960
What is it for?

13:09.960 --> 13:10.600
Just make it first.

13:10.600 --> 13:11.759
It is hard to explain right now.

13:11.759 --> 13:12.759
I am heading to prison.

13:12.799 --> 13:13.600
Alright.

13:13.759 --> 13:14.600
Take care.

13:15.587 --> 13:17.125
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

13:21.799 --> 13:23.000
Handle it carefully.

13:23.190 --> 13:24.210
Thank you for your effort.

13:27.919 --> 13:28.919
Lord Wei.

13:29.159 --> 13:30.159
Another fight?

13:30.240 --> 13:31.200
No fight.

13:31.310 --> 13:32.559
Just got into a bit of trouble.

13:32.559 --> 13:33.279
Nothing serious.

13:33.279 --> 13:34.360
I will be out in ten days or so.

13:34.360 --> 13:36.559
You really are one of a kind.

13:36.559 --> 13:37.879
Bringing all this to prison.

13:39.000 --> 13:39.799
My Lord,

13:39.960 --> 13:40.720
this spot

13:40.720 --> 13:42.240
is the best cell here.

13:42.240 --> 13:43.399
Dry, well ventilated,

13:43.480 --> 13:44.960
and even gets a bit of sunlight.

13:44.960 --> 13:46.679
We even set up this curtain for you.

13:46.679 --> 13:47.120
How is it?

13:47.120 --> 13:47.679
Satisfied?

13:48.200 --> 13:48.720
Not bad.

13:49.360 --> 13:51.000
From now on, this cell is mine.

13:51.050 --> 13:52.200
No one else is to stay here.

13:52.320 --> 13:53.399
Unless you ask me first,

13:53.399 --> 13:54.519
and I agree.

13:56.399 --> 13:57.759
If I am not here,

13:57.840 --> 13:58.919
leave it empty for me.

13:59.200 --> 14:00.759
Have someone come clean it regularly.

14:01.279 --> 14:02.080
Remember that.

14:04.120 --> 14:04.919
My Lord,

14:05.559 --> 14:06.600
this is a prison,

14:07.080 --> 14:08.159
not your home.

14:08.159 --> 14:09.399
Are you trying

14:09.399 --> 14:10.720
to reserve a room here?

14:12.320 --> 14:13.480
I would rather not.

14:14.720 --> 14:15.720
If you ask me,

14:16.000 --> 14:17.240
just stop getting into trouble.

14:17.240 --> 14:18.000
Look around.

14:18.000 --> 14:18.559
Here.

14:19.759 --> 14:21.759
This really is not a good place.

14:22.559 --> 14:23.759
Where is the table I asked for?

14:23.840 --> 14:25.279
Put it in the middle.

14:25.679 --> 14:26.399
Quick.

14:26.399 --> 14:27.399
The table.

14:27.679 --> 14:28.720
Here.

14:32.720 --> 14:33.879
Perfect.

14:49.759 --> 14:51.039
(Hao has done well.)

14:51.040 --> 14:52.790
(Even in prison,
he makes something of it.)

14:56.159 --> 14:56.679
Aunt,

14:56.879 --> 14:57.679
you are here.

14:58.639 --> 14:59.759
Come, set it up.

15:00.120 --> 15:01.120
Let us all eat together.

15:01.519 --> 15:02.159
Quick, quick.

15:02.559 --> 15:03.279
Aunt,

15:03.360 --> 15:05.159
did you bring wine for the brothers?

15:05.159 --> 15:05.879
No.

15:05.880 --> 15:06.919
You have not had your coming-of-age yet.

15:06.919 --> 15:07.799
You cannot drink.

15:08.240 --> 15:09.480
That is right, My Lord.

15:09.639 --> 15:11.000
We cannot drink either.

15:11.240 --> 15:11.960
We are

15:12.159 --> 15:13.360
on duty.

15:13.519 --> 15:14.279
Another day,

15:14.440 --> 15:15.759
when we go to Juxian Restaurant,

15:15.759 --> 15:17.159
you can treat us to drinks then.

15:17.679 --> 15:18.480
That works.

15:19.039 --> 15:19.879
Then,

15:20.120 --> 15:20.759
let us eat.

15:21.279 --> 15:21.720
Together.

15:21.720 --> 15:22.480
Thank you, My Lord.

15:22.759 --> 15:23.279
Come on.

15:23.279 --> 15:24.279
Everyone, come.

15:25.960 --> 15:26.919
Smells great.

15:27.039 --> 15:28.320
- Smells great.
- Smells great.

15:30.120 --> 15:31.159
This braised pork,

15:31.159 --> 15:31.960
rich but not greasy.

15:32.110 --> 15:33.039
The shrimp is good too.

15:33.039 --> 15:34.180
- Let me try.
- Let me try.

15:34.440 --> 15:36.279
So fragrant.

15:36.720 --> 15:37.519
Who is this?

15:37.519 --> 15:38.720
Here to serve time?

15:45.862 --> 15:48.692
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

15:49.312 --> 15:52.712
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

15:53.482 --> 15:56.432
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

15:56.772 --> 15:59.472
♪Sigh and walk away♪

16:01.072 --> 16:04.542
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

16:04.542 --> 16:06.772
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

16:06.772 --> 16:08.882
♪Colors and darkness♪

16:08.882 --> 16:10.902
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

16:10.902 --> 16:15.262
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

16:16.702 --> 16:20.432
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

16:20.702 --> 16:24.302
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

16:24.462 --> 16:26.542
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

16:26.542 --> 16:31.332
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

16:31.552 --> 16:33.172
♪The world mistakes me♪

16:33.172 --> 16:35.512
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

16:35.582 --> 16:36.772
♪As the storm approaches♪

16:36.772 --> 16:39.172
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

16:39.382 --> 16:41.102
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

16:41.102 --> 16:43.082
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

16:43.252 --> 16:45.002
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

16:45.002 --> 16:47.102
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

16:47.102 --> 16:48.572
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

16:48.572 --> 16:50.802
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

16:51.022 --> 16:52.222
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

16:52.222 --> 16:54.742
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

16:54.872 --> 16:56.582
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

16:56.582 --> 16:57.862
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

16:58.012 --> 16:59.432
♪My wish has finally come true♪

16:59.432 --> 17:00.472
♪To stay by your side♪

17:00.472 --> 17:02.392
♪In this fleeting world♪

17:02.562 --> 17:05.812
♪We are free and happy♪

17:09.812 --> 17:11.592
♪From a nobody♪

17:11.592 --> 17:13.492
♪To someone now famous♪

17:13.602 --> 17:15.032
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

17:15.032 --> 17:17.542
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

17:17.642 --> 17:19.222
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

17:19.222 --> 17:21.292
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

17:21.502 --> 17:23.182
♪In this vast world♪

17:23.182 --> 17:25.182
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

17:25.332 --> 17:27.542
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

17:27.542 --> 17:29.132
♪Everything ends eventually♪

17:29.222 --> 17:30.722
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

17:30.722 --> 17:33.122
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

17:33.122 --> 17:34.832
♪No matter how time flies♪

17:34.832 --> 17:35.992
♪Even if the falling snow♪

17:35.992 --> 17:37.622
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

17:37.622 --> 17:38.662
♪All I want now♪

17:38.662 --> 17:40.762
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

17:40.762 --> 17:44.022
♪Year after year♪
